[{"title":"谢孙瀛州","author":"朱升","text":"昨日长桥访隐庐，今朝寓馆辱高车。\n宣尼作么报阳虎，张禄元来是范雎。\n避暑寺中相约旧，挹和石水纳交初。\n不堪携剌来看处，马首匆匆问所如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46011,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵谢陈正父","author":"朱升","text":"年来多难剧伤心，难向蓍龟问陆沉。\n背我年华唯自惜，动人春色不渠禁。\n愚如伯鲁非忘旧，归愧渊明未觉今。\n珍重主人临别意，谩依新韵献微吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46012,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柏山齐祈寺和唐子华韵","author":"朱升","text":"西风笳鼓东南来，国本应须老手裁。\n净洗甲兵过练水，早随冠冕上云台。\n传宣马系门前柳，伯颂人磨石上苔。\n机会到时须勇进，天边莫待羽书催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46013,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次罗应玉凌云台韵","author":"朱升","text":"台扁凌云俯碧园，众芳围绕绿阴繁。\n崇高不数重山艮，坚实疑加载物坤。\n卧看青云行碧落，吟倾绿醑泛清尊。\n佳名妙句两臻极，总有飘飘逸气存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46014,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送方伯润松萝山读书","author":"朱升","text":"一上松萝数千刃，学如九转炼还丹。\n且将员木警宵寐，莫厌断齑供昼餐。\n松叶乱云孤嶂暝，杏花疏雨晚窗寒。\n乐羊莫起思乡念，应误佳人机杼难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46015,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题凤山余镛读书处","author":"朱升","text":"凤凰山上凤凰鸣，凤去山留百代名。\n世治有人来结屋，月明何处听吹笙。\n碧梧翠竹炎光薄，黄卷青灯夜气清。\n会见来仪为世瑞，九重天上待蜚声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46016,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得詹田佳城","author":"朱升","text":"风水集詹田，藏川夹石川。\n遛心垂半世，藏体付千年。\n海内风尘息，城南灯火偏。\n亲朋何用哭，含笑入黄泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46017,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢陈弘道饮余春酒","author":"朱升","text":"昨来叨宴遇，剪烛夜沉沉。\n和气醉连昔，谢名迟到今。\n无人共酬景，有憾易伤心。\n祗合移高馆，清谈听鹤林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46018,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒食作","author":"朱升","text":"浮生悬美晤，苍昊■幽期。\n滂沛五更雨，留连三月时。\n林园成绿暗，花树失红滋。\n倘有游观兴，黄花未是迟。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46019,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈自新上永新 其一","author":"朱升","text":"有客志高远，不柰拙谋生。\n将须出肺肝，四座相为惊。\n何门可拽裾，何处有鱼羹？\n豪杰乍相见，为尔嗟不平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46020,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈自新上永新 其二","author":"朱升","text":"南窗脱乌帻，汗颗不胜洒。\n此际向长途，知非得已者。\n木川郁佳树，已是息波马。\n川云肯上天，须臾雨天下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46021,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈自新上永新 其三","author":"朱升","text":"元帅古郤縠，好客今郑庄。\n庇人千万处，况乃敦同乡。\n作客亦有时，为乐不可常。\n油幕饱膏馥，勉尔归屠羊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46022,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"驾陈亨衢长子迁新居并序","author":"朱升","text":"圣王尊命士，父子不同宫。\n末俗□陈迹，名家尚古风。\n过庭诗礼旧，分橐酒肴丰。\n超出斯干上，高堂坐媪翁。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46023,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其一 四美堂","author":"朱升","text":"有客留题四美堂，东涂西抹妄平章。\n元来只是四时好，雪月风花相发扬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46024,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其二 东园","author":"朱升","text":"卉木亭台景实稠，不留隙地豁吟眸。\n举头见有空闲处，又构飞云十二楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46025,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其三 环秀楼","author":"朱升","text":"楼外周环列秀峰，先生爱此意无穷。\n不放水纹浮枕簟，但教栏槛倚晴空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46026,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其四 青子亭","author":"朱升","text":"杭人食梅不待酸，只须豆样荐金盘。\n若教青子亭中坐，看有何人不整冠？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46027,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其五 芳馨亭","author":"朱升","text":"满架芳尘似雪开，眼鼻受用贪忘回。\n暮归却被娇娥问：何处惹得香风来？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46028,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其六 长春亭","author":"朱升","text":"月挂棠花不但梢，欺人憔悴强婆娑。\n主公也有长春药，千壶倾倒醉颜酡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46029,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其七 花仙径","author":"朱升","text":"二月时光春事浓，海棠花发透脂红。\n若还真有仙风味，那得中间一径通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46030,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其八 武陵源","author":"朱升","text":"武陵源里桃花春，世俗传闻昧伪真。\n早知只在东园里，大有高人来问津。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46031,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其九 济舟亭","author":"朱升","text":"为怕燕姬翠黛愁，画船舣阁两津头。\n因兹便得济川妙，只用舆梁安用舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46032,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其十 岁寒亭","author":"朱升","text":"后凋向说柏共松，今此名亭又不同。\n直为正心难屈致，但蟠香叶绿茐茐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46033,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为陈弘道题十一首 其十一 得心亭","author":"朱升","text":"乐得之心自有邮，智仁肯向陈编求？\n威望何如山厚重，机心未逊水周流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46034,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠星士汪晓窗 其一","author":"朱升","text":"五星三命元非古，后世推详便尔灵。\n若舍根源求克应，晓窗谈说自堪听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46035,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠星士汪晓窗 其二","author":"朱升","text":"十人谈命九无术，有术逢迎不直言。\n今日见君成促坐，清风蕃露洒前轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46036,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠星士汪晓窗 其三","author":"朱升","text":"纷纷世俗爱言好，好命如今见者稀。\n言好暂欢终受訾，晓窗不是欠圆机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46037,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠星士汪晓窗 其四","author":"朱升","text":"不掩逸邅不讳贫，高谈慷慨见天真。\n彦章自是江南宝，且向江湖觅好人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46038,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠星士汪晓窗 其五","author":"朱升","text":"我亦劳居算五行，三分富厚七分清。\n春深雨足长青草，数亩山田自可耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46039,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登颜公山","author":"朱升","text":"咫尺九天低日月，分明千里俯山川。\n颜公登蹠只如此，空悔尘中六十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46040,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留金陵送毕功大州判归 其一","author":"朱升","text":"杨枝袅娜酒旗摇，人去人来朱雀桥。\n老我送君人送我，迟迟几许意难消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46041,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留金陵送毕功大州判归 其二","author":"朱升","text":"醅芽茶觜挹流泉，人世纷纷我是仙。\n客里自悲还自释，歙山享用已多年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46042,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留金陵送毕功大州判归 其三","author":"朱升","text":"碧流清浅且无波，酒鼎船头秋月多。\n舍弟同游应念我，我诗有味好吟哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46043,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留金陵送毕功大州判归 其四","author":"朱升","text":"劳佚人生各有宜，扶桑汲汲有崦嵫。\n毕公今日还山喜，似我当初得举时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46044,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其一","author":"朱升","text":"一别刘郎万里遥，少年背我暗魂消。\n屋檐初日喧黄口，拥被孤眠又一宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46045,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其二","author":"朱升","text":"寂寂深闺春昼长，憾郎不为惜流光。\n画文剥尽琵琶面，好似奴儿去后妆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46046,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其三","author":"朱升","text":"昔日红桃花发时，每挼花片心琼肌。\n如今却被桃花笑，晓揽青铜草样萎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46047,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其四","author":"朱升","text":"生来最不耐离愁，缜日娇啼倚画楼。\n邻舍女儿兢相笑，奴家半月不梳头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46048,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其五","author":"朱升","text":"一春芳事在青郊，红杏将花豆蔻苗。\n嬉伴昨宵相约定，谁知痴雨打花朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46049,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其六","author":"朱升","text":"东风疑不到窗纱，惊见盆桃尽着花。\n郎意岂胜春意荡，远游亦合暂还家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46050,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其七","author":"朱升","text":"了了如欢杳杳悲，凝情尽日听乌衣。\n郎归莫作呢喃语，薄幸疑君说是非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46051,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其八","author":"朱升","text":"庭前红杏笑嫣然，前日初开蝶恣穿。\n轻翅不来留粉在，空教妾意憾当年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46052,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其九","author":"朱升","text":"春来花月胜秋光，也为离人照断肠。\n何日儿夫重携手，清宵不复倚颓墙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46053,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"代人作春闺怨十首 其十","author":"朱升","text":"狂夫一去不思归，桃叶能随柳絮飞？\n惆怅北溪溪上路，只同梦里唱金衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46054,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春水画骨歌","author":"陈仁锡","text":"放舟春水听龙吼，九龙之山一培塿。\n我生有骨倩君手，笔走星辰酌大斗。\n床头万卷去其朽，饱啖鲜霞如啖藕。\n采茶阳羡调尊卤，新植芙蓉二十亩。\n竟日关门简徒偶，至尊独夏谁司咎。\n赤心事君以求友，肝胆应许奉元首。\n生来不受利名牵，谈笑烟霞挥敝帚。\n添入长松鸣蚴蟉，敬赓天保上君寿。\n东南力竭何所有，聊写莱麦在图右。\n我欲持图上黼扆，长随父老击牛酒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46055,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜渡金山 其一","author":"陈仁锡","text":"南国崔嵬势尽来，烟帆齐向镜中开。\n长空挂月疑无地，大海回风忽有山。\n以我宝刀随流水，何年锦浪起楼台。\n妙高深忆济时者，江左风流有异才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46056,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜渡金山 其二","author":"陈仁锡","text":"元良齿学简成均，朴遫如臣厕友宾。\n坐对空江邀祖逖，遥呼三诏愧焦君。\n深更细听鱼龙语，片苇平分吴楚云。\n独使至尊忧社稷，肯教终日醉曛曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46057,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜渡金山 其三","author":"陈仁锡","text":"忆昔读书金山寺，墨花喷浪上青霄。\n楼台影碎云根活，潮汐磨砻鬼斧销。\n卷石无多阅世脱，龙宫一半住僧寮。\n涛声时共人声语，静吸中冷说圣朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46058,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东阿李侯","author":"陈仁锡","text":"千峰高枕绿炊烟，蕉叶题诗课野田。\n稽古已知卑管晏，匡时犹未薄鱼盐。\n东湖令借西湖长，明圣池连泰岱泉。\n吏散空庭鸟雀静，远山云起任挥弦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46059,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河间王太守","author":"陈仁锡","text":"河瀛望巴借深筹，樗栎还勤药笼搜。\n朝以扁公为太守，天教赤子作桓侯。\n同人犹自称秦越，运腕先须问乐愁。\n昔有真人入御梦，一凡名已动金瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46060,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山海关前屯副将军饮 其一","author":"陈仁锡","text":"前屯松树何笼嵷，手挽山河百二重。\n犬吠严城都似豹，铃摇清角语皆龙。\n阵云战苦忠魂厉，塞月清悬赤胆同。\n听说西戎发上指，拟将提槊向云中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46061,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山海关前屯副将军饮 其二","author":"陈仁锡","text":"宁前一线扼咽喉，壮士提刀孰与俦。\n山海当关蹲虎豹，肝肠如雪彻箜篌。\n精严壁垒云麾壮，吐纳天河楼橹稠。\n结发屯奴七十战，何愁李广不封侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46062,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宁远鼓楼与将士痛饮励战 其一","author":"陈仁锡","text":"渐看光复慰疮痍，岳页重瞻旧汉仪。\n自有肝肠清塞北，肯容儿女梦辽西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46063,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宁远鼓楼与将士痛饮励战 其二","author":"陈仁锡","text":"膂力经营谁与先，十年战守说宁前。\n朔方重见尧日月，乐浪骎增汉幅员。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46064,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中后所王司农即席","author":"陈仁锡","text":"海天暝色上高楼，刁斗霜严万籁收。\n粉蝶不来无树梦，钓矶未断有馀舟。\n六年旧识胡安定，一夜欣逢萧酂侯。\n知是雄边清白吏，选人央袋合深筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46065,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何承渠副将军招同张午垣徐都阃饮首山时桃花一枝开汤泉重搆祖帅治海舟待渡 其一","author":"陈仁锡","text":"无虑峰头十丈松，长髯慷慨复颂容。\n首山东望医闾峙，星使北来牛斗冲。\n席向觉华邀祖楫，泉如汤沸檄桃红。\n我行未睹单于面，拔剑中霄待举烽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46066,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"何承渠副将军招同张午垣徐都阃饮首山时桃花一枝开汤泉重搆祖帅治海舟待渡 其二","author":"陈仁锡","text":"徐孺陈蕃塞上从，侯谁在矣张仲同。\n君横长菜除丑虏，我有玄言问老龙。\n山向至尊齐拱极，水因剑折必朝宗。\n如今不卖卢龙塞，万国车书四海瀜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46067,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赵元戎招饮角山观海楼移酌署中","author":"陈仁锡","text":"岩关开府镇羌氐，舜曰蝉联沛泽瀰。\n大海东来驻箕尾，男儿到此照须眉。\n锦州苦战身为堞，渤澥狂歌浪是匜。\n我亦逢君大敌勇，且倾三百任樽移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46068,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"前屯登赵将军城试万人敌放三火箭忽闻传烽登高阅战虏首至自瑞云堡","author":"陈仁锡","text":"前屯自古瑞州城，兵火空馀一塔撑。\n至圣庙前剩有树，三山堡内半鸣钲。\n楼台倒下貔貅静，肉薄俄惊神鬼轰。\n提剑须叟虏首至，将军不减赵奢名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46069,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛游燕赵怀古 其一","author":"陈仁锡","text":"丹忠只有君侯血，兵冗先知宋室空。\n十载汤阴浑梦是，睢州又过岳王宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46070,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛游燕赵怀古 其二","author":"陈仁锡","text":"戴星蹇涉渡滹河，八郡良家气若何。\n易水昔寒今已热，制奴还少一荆轲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46071,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛游燕赵怀古 其三","author":"陈仁锡","text":"可怜六国佳公子，不及燕山太子丹。\n裘马无宁取胡服，柏松长愧血秦关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46072,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛游燕赵怀古 其四","author":"陈仁锡","text":"天旌公子侯门死，图挟樊期七首孤。\n止为汉家真帝出，亡秦元不是燕胡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46073,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛游燕赵怀古 其五","author":"陈仁锡","text":"梦里寻身身亦假，醒来觅梦梦还真。\n源头识得皆由我，道在无求梦不侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46074,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洛游燕赵怀古 其六","author":"陈仁锡","text":"茕茕满目挂征鞍，母在肯教襁褓残。\n今日路旁皆孝子，身寒不敢泣衣单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46075,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河北道中","author":"陈仁锡","text":"贼徒拥邯郸，杀士不敢格。\n纵横曹濮间，未知兵与贼。\n中州有风怪，铁碎瓦独全。\n更看险绝处，九霄石碓悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46076,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周藩册封礼成时中秋夜雨 其一","author":"陈仁锡","text":"磐石藩屏骏有声，超然大雅自仙盟。\n钦承册命持龙节，式睹宗仪仰圣明。\n天子万年周室辅，中州一镜四方平。\n汴城自古沾恩地，月到天心雨欲晴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46077,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周藩册封礼成时中秋夜雨 其二","author":"陈仁锡","text":"周宗世美赋振振，公姓公孙礼法遵。\n齿德占星瑞河洛，诗书赓雅动枫宸。\n鱼蒲龙节君恩重，玉树金枝桂窟新。\n何待夜珠来明月，五风十两总皇仁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46078,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周藩册封礼成时中秋夜雨 其三","author":"陈仁锡","text":"持节郊关凛至尊，惇庸典礼展周亲。\n中天轮影环明月，万国元良仰一人。\n白发苍颜班帝子，稚龄绣褓舞王孙。\n岁其有矣干戈息，四海澄清快合辰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46079,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周藩册封礼成时中秋夜雨 其四","author":"陈仁锡","text":"一点天心到岳嵩，维城雄险亘苍穹。\n图书皆五秋分半，皇极兼三日正中。\n仁义率先尊柱础，本支卜世种高松。\n讲筵无补勤咨询，汴土艰难启圣聪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46080,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]